nt-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 10px;line-height:1.5\">\r\n<span class=\"b k\" style=\"font-size:27px;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px;line-height:1.5\">  1 big thing: There&#x27;s a book club for that </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>   <tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td> <img src=\"https://images.axios.com/IN8TweoTdt4tv7woaB3vv3P-5yc=/0x0:1280x720/2026/08/24/1787604519601.gif\" width=\"600\" style=\"width:100%\" id=\"item02\" alt=\"Animated illustration of a book that opens to a page about halfway through, where an event ticket is revealed.\"> </td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:0 3.5%;line-height:1.3\">\r\n<span class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#848484\"> <p>Illustration: Brendan Lynch/Axios</p> </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr> <tr>\r\n<td class=\"v\" style=\"padding:0 3.5%;line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px\"><p><strong>Americans may be <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47416130.425885/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tLzIwMjUvMDgvMjcvcmVhZGluZy1ib29rcy1wbGVhc3VyZS1kYXRhP3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB230105a4\" target=\"_blank\">reading less</a>, </strong>but <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47416130.425885/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tLzIwMjYvMDcvMDMvYm9va3N0b3Jlcy1iYXJuZXMtbm9ibGUtamFtZXMtZGF1bnQ_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXJfYXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnN0cmVhbT10b3A/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB0d721419\" target=\"_blank\">bookstores are thriving</a> and book clubs are bringing people together.</p><ul><li><strong>Book club events </strong>on Eventbrite jumped 33% during the first half of this year compared with the same time last year, <em>Axios' Sami Sparber reports.</em></li></ul><p><strong>👀 The intrigue: </strong>The book club boom has been largely driven by \"hyper niche\" meetups that bring together readers who love the same genres or have the same hobbies, Eventbrite says.</p><ul><li><strong>Readers are lacing up corsets </strong>and attaching prosthetic fairy ears <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47416130.425885/aHR0cHM6Ly9mYWJsZXNhbmRmbGFtZXMuY29tLz91dG1fc291cmNlPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXImdXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bmV3c2xldHRlcl9heGlvc2ZpbmlzaGxpbmUmc3RyZWFtPXRvcA/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aBf8c55b16\" target=\"_blank\">to gather</a> with fellow fans of the red-hot \"<a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47416130.425885/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tLzIwMjYvMDUvMDQvdGlrdG9rLWJvb2t0b2stZmFuZG9tLWZpbG0tc3RyZWFtaW5nP3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB0b0d226a\" target=\"_blank\">romantasy</a>\" genre.</li><li><strong>They're reading together</strong> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47416130.425885/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tLzIwMjUvMTEvMTIvc2lsZW50LWJvb2stY2x1Yi1vcmlnaW5hbC13aGF0LWlzP3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB50f91737\" target=\"_blank\">silently</a>, sometimes not even the same book.</li><li><strong>Indie bookstores</strong> are hosting clubs for people who want to craft while they discuss books.</li></ul><p><strong>👻 Case in point: </strong>At Atlanta bookstore <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47416130.425885/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cub2ZmYmVhdGJvb2tzLmNvbS8_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXJfYXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnN0cmVhbT10b3A/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB5fb8faac\" target=\"_blank\">Offbeat Books</a>, each book club has its own vibe, owner Lindsi Bollinger tells Axios.</p><ul><li><strong>The horror club </strong>spills into movie talk, while the nonfiction club is run \"pretty much like a classroom,\" with PowerPoints, a projector and discussion questions.</li><li><strong>There's also a </strong>\"<a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47416130.425885/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZ29vZHJlYWRzLmNvbS9zaGVsZi9zaG93L3dlaXJkLWdpcmw_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXJfYXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnN0cmVhbT10b3A/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aBa052948b\" target=\"_blank\">weird girl</a>\" reading group — part of a literary trend celebrating books with messy, strange, complicated female protagonists.</li></ul><p>👥 <strong>Between the lines: </strong>Book clubs are also getting a lift as younger people get more into <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47416130.425885/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tLzIwMjUvMTAvMjMvYW5hbG9nLWJhZy1zY3JlZW4tZnJlZS13ZWxsbmVzcz91dG1fc291cmNlPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXImdXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bmV3c2xldHRlcl9heGlvc2ZpbmlzaGxpbmUmc3RyZWFtPXRvcA/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aBaff7cdf9\" target=\"_blank\">offline hobbies</a> and <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47416130.425885/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tLzIwMjYvMDUvMTMvc2luZ2xlcy1ldmVudHMtZGF0aW5nLWFwcC1mYXRpZ3VlP3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aBf73a59c1\" target=\"_blank\">in-person</a> hangouts.</p><ul><li><strong>\"One of my favorite parts</strong> of book club is when we have ended the book club and people are just talking to each other … maybe making plans outside of the book club,\"<strong> </strong>says Hannah Mathews,<strong> </strong>a bookseller at Offbeat Books who facilitates the \"weird girl\" club.</li></ul><p><em><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47416130.425885/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tLzIwMjYvMDkvMTAvYm9vay1jbHViLW5pY2hlLWV2ZW50P3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB6d789df2\" target=\"_blank\">Share this story</a>.</em></p></td>\r\n</tr> <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 25px\">   <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47416130.425885/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZmFjZWJvb2suY29tL3NoYXJlci5waHA_dT1odHRwczovL3d3dy5heGlvcy5jb20vbmV3c2xldHRlcnMvYXhpb3MtZmluaXNoLWxpbmUtNmEzNDc5M2EtYWQ0NS00MjNlLWEwMDQtMTQ4YTAyOTI1M2Y2Lmh0bWw_Y2h1bmslM0QxJTI2dXRtX3Rlcm0lM0RmYnNvY2lhbHNoYXJlJTIzc3RvcnkxJnV0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB906efd67\" style=\"display:inline-block\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-facebook-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Share on Facebook\"></a> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47416130.425885/aHR0cHM6Ly90d2l0dGVyLmNvbS9pbnRlbnQvdHdlZXQ_\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:7px\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-x-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Tweet this Story\"></a> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47416130.\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:7px\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-linkedin-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Post to LinkedIn\"></a>  <a href=\"mailto:?subject=From Axios: 1 big thing: There&#x27;s a book club for that&body=teruyuki%40hh.iij4u.or.jp%20has%20shared%20an%20Axios%20story%20with%20you%3A%0A%0A1 big thing: There&#x27;s a book club for that%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.axios.com%2Fnewsletters%2Faxios-finish-line-6a34793a-ad45-423e-a004-148a029253f6.html%3Fchunk%3D1%26utm_term%3Demshare%23story1\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:7px\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\